1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,900
You're walking into a meeting. You need the three people actually waiting on you.

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:11,040
Relay reads your Telegram, extracts the ask, and puts it on your glasses.

3
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:19,550
Hold the ring. Say it badly. Relay cleans it up. One tap sends it. Four left. Your phone never left your pocket.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,870
The brief is already clear.

5
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,810
Channels wait in a digest. No interruptions.

6
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:37,070
Now the other kind of open loop. A Telegram signal, live Hyperliquid data, and a paper position.

7
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:45,580
Say de-risk twenty-five. Confirm. The risk is cut. No keys. No real funds.

8
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:48,990
Liquidation moved away. Paper only.

9
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:56,670
Back to people. Pair Telegram with a six-digit code. Read. Speak. Confirm.

10
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:01,970
Sensitive asks never get a default yes. Review first.

11
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:06,120
Relay. Read. Speak. Confirm.
